<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-JUN					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-JUN					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Peter, with 50 mph winds, is in the Philippine Sea near 19.8n/127.0e, moving north at 13 mph. Peter is expected to intensify further with top winds reaching 70 mph within 36 hours. It will continue northward during this period, into the waters east of Taiwan. After 36 hours, Peter should turn northeast to east and weaken, threatening only shipping.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
